IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-ta-versions`

-- Tests of sgta-ta-versions.l4.  Every expected value is written by hand from the deposited Gazette texts (registers/source-bundle/TA1999.20001230.txt, TA1999.ACT22-2016.txt, TA1999.S461-2016.txt, TA1999.ACT30-2016.txt, TA1999.S14-2017.txt,
-- TA1999.ACT10-2005.txt, TA1999.ACT19-2011.txt, TA1999.S33-2012.txt) and the Act's Legislative History (TA1999.txt:7134-7151).
-- Every case is a pair of days: the CONDUCT day first, the READING day second.

§ `The edges of the 2000 Revised Edition and Act 10 of 2005`

-- Revised Edition 2000: effective and published 30 December 2000
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 29 12 2000) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 30 12 2000) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `Revised Edition 2000`
-- read on the day the edition is dated, for conduct on that day
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 30 12 2000) (Date 30 12 2000) EQUALS JUST `Revised Edition 2000`
-- a reading day before the edition: nothing was published
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 30 12 2000) (Date 29 12 2000) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Act 10 of 2005: effective 16 February 2005, first published 16 February 2005
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 15 2 2005) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `Revised Edition 2000`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 16 2 2005) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
-- conduct on the effective day, read the day before the Act was published: the Revised Edition still stands
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 16 2 2005) (Date 15 2 2005) EQUALS JUST `Revised Edition 2000`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 16 2 2005) (Date 16 2 2005) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
-- 1 January 2011 as read on a day in 2011 and as read today: the same version (neither Act 10 of 2005 nor Act 19 of 2011 is retrospective)
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 1 2011) (Date 1 1 2011) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 1 2011) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`

§ `The edge of Act 19 of 2011: published 20 January 2012 with no date; S 33/2012 published 31 January 2012 fixes 1 February 2012`

#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 31 1 2012) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2012) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`
-- read on 30 January 2012, the Act is in the Gazette (20 January) but its date of effect is not (31 January): for conduct on 1 February the older text stands
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2012) (Date 30 1 2012) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2012) (Date 31 1 2012) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2012) (Date 20 1 2012) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
-- conduct on 31 January 2012 is governed by the older text however late it is read
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 31 1 2012) (Date 1 3 2012) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`

§ `Acts 22 and 30 of 2016, Act 15 of 2017, the Acts after it (one row, not split), and the deposited consolidation`

-- Act 22 of 2016: first published 29 Sep 2016 (with S 461/2016), in operation 1 Oct 2016
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 30 9 2016) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 10 2016) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 10 2016) (Date 28 9 2016) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 10 2016) (Date 30 9 2016) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 10 2016) (Date 29 9 2016) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
-- Act 30 of 2016: first published 9 Jan 2017; S 14/2017, first published 13 Jan 2017, appoints 1 Feb 2017; the version counts as published on 13 Jan 2017
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 31 1 2017) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2017) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2017) (Date 12 1 2017) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2017) (Date 13 1 2017) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 2 2017) (Date 9 1 2017) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
-- Act 15 of 2017 (the first Act after Act 30 of 2016 on the Legislative History; Acts Supplement No. 17 of 2017, first published 30 Mar 2017) is in operation on 23 May 2017 (the Legislative History's day; the commencement notification is not deposited)
-- Act 26 of 2018 (s 61, 16 May 2018) is the next Act on the history; it is deposited (2026-11-04) but is not a row of this version table
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 22 5 2017) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 23 5 2017) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 15 of 2017`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 23 5 2017) (Date 22 5 2017) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 15 5 2018) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 15 of 2017`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 16 5 2018) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 16 5 2018) (Date 15 5 2018) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 15 of 2017`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 1 2019) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 1 2019) (Date 1 1 2018) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 15 of 2017`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 23 5 2017) (Date 29 3 2017) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 1 10 2026) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 2 10 2026) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 4 11 2026) (Date 4 11 2026) EQUALS JUST `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`
-- conduct on 2 October 2026, read on the day before the consolidation's date of effect: not yet the consolidation
#ASSERT `TA versions: the version of the Act's text that governs the conduct day, as read on the reading day` (Date 2 10 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) EQUALS JUST `as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited`

§ `Which versions have a deposited text`

#ASSERT `TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `Revised Edition 2000`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `as amended by Act 15 of 2017`
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `as amended by Acts after Act 15 of 2017 that are not deposited`)
#ASSERT `TA versions: the text of the version is deposited` `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`

§ `What differs between the versions`

-- s 2 "equipment" ended "telecommunication purposes" until Act 19 of 2011 took effect (RevEd 2000 line 227; Act 19 of 2011 section 2(b))
#ASSERT `TA versions: s 2 "equipment" ends "used or intended to be used for telecommunication purposes"` `Revised Edition 2000`
#ASSERT `TA versions: s 2 "equipment" ends "used or intended to be used for telecommunication purposes"` `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 2 "equipment" ends "used or intended to be used for telecommunication purposes"` `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 2 "equipment" ends "used or intended to be used for telecommunication purposes"` `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`)
-- the daily fine for a continuing offence came with Act 10 of 2005 (section 28)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: the general penalty has a further daily fine for a continuing offence` `Revised Edition 2000`)
#ASSERT `TA versions: the general penalty has a further daily fine for a continuing offence` `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the general penalty has a further daily fine for a continuing offence` `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the general penalty has a further daily fine for a continuing offence` `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`
-- the carve-out for broadcasting apparatus named the Singapore Broadcasting Authority Act until Act 10 of 2005 (section 30)
#ASSERT `TA versions: the carve-out for broadcasting apparatus names the Singapore Broadcasting Authority Act (Cap. 297)` `Revised Edition 2000`
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: the carve-out for broadcasting apparatus names the Singapore Broadcasting Authority Act (Cap. 297)` `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: the carve-out for broadcasting apparatus names the Singapore Broadcasting Authority Act (Cap. 297)` `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`)

-- Acts 22 and 30 of 2016 change none of these three (section lists: TA1999.ACT22-2016.txt section 100; TA1999.ACT30-2016.txt sections 2 to 20): "equipment" is untouched,
-- the general penalty and the carve-out are untouched
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 2 "equipment" ends "used or intended to be used for telecommunication purposes"` `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 2 "equipment" ends "used or intended to be used for telecommunication purposes"` `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`)
#ASSERT `TA versions: the general penalty has a further daily fine for a continuing offence` `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: the general penalty has a further daily fine for a continuing offence` `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: the carve-out for broadcasting apparatus names the Singapore Broadcasting Authority Act (Cap. 297)` `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: the carve-out for broadcasting apparatus names the Singapore Broadcasting Authority Act (Cap. 297)` `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`)

-- s 33(1), now s 53(1): the suspension words arrive with Act 30 of 2016 (section 18, in operation 1 February 2017)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 33(1), now s 53(1), names the suspension of the person's licence` `Revised Edition 2000`)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 33(1), now s 53(1), names the suspension of the person's licence` `as amended by Act 10 of 2005`)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 33(1), now s 53(1), names the suspension of the person's licence` `as amended by Act 19 of 2011`)
#ASSERT NOT (`TA versions: s 33(1), now s 53(1), names the suspension of the person's licence` `as amended by Act 22 of 2016`)
#ASSERT `TA versions: s 33(1), now s 53(1), names the suspension of the person's licence` `as amended by Act 30 of 2016`
#ASSERT `TA versions: s 33(1), now s 53(1), names the suspension of the person's licence` `the 2020 Revised Edition as deposited from SSO`
